==============================================================================
NOT EXECUTED — 18 words, crunch-only. Reasons below; these are
COVERAGE HOLES IN THIS PROBE, not evidence of support.
==============================================================================
  renum     renumbers the stored program; harmless but needs a program to be visible
  delete    deletes stored lines — would eat the batch's own program
  auto      INTERACTIVE: enters auto-line-number mode and swallows all following input
  lprint    LSTOUT not hang-safe with no printer plugged
  llist     same LSTOUT hazard
  lpos      same LSTOUT hazard
  interval  needs a stored ON INTERVAL=n GOSUB program + a timed window; covered by probes/basic/basic_probe_interval_trap.py (T5 slice), not duplicated here
  dski      NEEDS-DISK: raw sector READ — needs a disk, out of scope here
  dsko      NEEDS-DISK: raw sector WRITE — DESTRUCTIVE, never executed
  copy      NEEDS-DISK: file copy — needs a disk fixture
  set       NEEDS-DISK: Disk-BASIC SET — needs a disk fixture
  attr      NEEDS-DISK: MSX-DOS2-era; measured for the record
  ipl       NEEDS-DISK: boot-sector write — DESTRUCTIVE, never executed
  cmd       vendor hook; unknown side effects
  lfiles    NEEDS-DISK: printer-bound (LSTOUT hazard); tracked in TODO
  loc       NEEDS-DISK: needs an open channel; tracked in TODO §File-position
  wait      can spin forever — never executed in a batch
  inputdol  BLOCKS waiting for a keypress

